{"comment":"The host document. The IDE loads <pageUrl>#ticket=<ticket> in the browser of the instance. No request carries the fragment, and the page takes the ticket from it and removes it from its address. GET / with the exact Host answers the same static document to each request of one run: no data, no state and no ticket, with its CSP. air-ide serves no other path and no other method: the IDE serves the scripts of the page from its request handler under the same origin."}
